// CotSC v53: original v5.1 River District unified component preserved.
// This is a single installation transaction; original eight-part area/quest work
// remains in its author-tested installation order.
BEGIN @6033

REQUIRE_PREDICATE GAME_IS ~eet~ ~River District requires EET.~
// Prevent overlaying a separately installed Brewery; the merged build owns QCBREW
// and its world-map registration. Only one installation should own those resources.
FORBID_COMPONENT ~setup-qc-brewery.tp2~ 0 ~Standalone Forest Brewery is still installed. Uninstall it with setup-qc-brewery.exe BEFORE installing this merged component (and keep a save-game backup).~
FORBID_COMPONENT ~setup-qriv-music.tp2~ 0 ~Old River District Music addon is still installed. Uninstall the historical components in reverse order before installing this unified component.~
FORBID_COMPONENT ~setup-qriv-people.tp2~ 0 ~Old River District People addon is still installed. Do not layer the unified component over it.~
FORBID_COMPONENT ~setup-qriv-repairs.tp2~ 0 ~Old River District Repairs addon is still installed. Uninstall the historical addons first.~
FORBID_COMPONENT ~setup-qriv-felicity.tp2~ 0 ~Old River District Felicity addon is still installed. Uninstall the historical addons first.~
FORBID_COMPONENT ~setup-qriv-interiors.tp2~ 0 ~Old River District Interiors addon is still installed. Uninstall the historical addons first.~
FORBID_COMPONENT ~setup-qriv-houses.tp2~ 0 ~Old River District Houses addon is still installed. Uninstall the historical addons first.~

INCLUDE ~CotSC/components/river_district/install.tph~


